  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 25904304128
    m_Localized: Teleportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29020672000
    m_Localized: Moves with such supernatural speed that they are said to cross the
      land in the blink of an eye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50025746432
    m_Localized: 'Movement Speed: 12.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 52752044032
    m_Localized: Diamond Body
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55532867584
    m_Localized: Through relentless ascetic training, the practitioner has hardened
      both body and mind against even the mightiest blows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58586320896
    m_Localized: Damage Taken -30% at all times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 171098525696
    m_Localized: Grudge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 173606719488
    m_Localized: A being consumed by deep resentment sends a malignant curse toward
      those who harm it, weakening their resolve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 175355744256
    m_Localized: 'When attacked: 10% chance to inflict Intimidated on the attacker.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 176098136064
    m_Localized: Slaughter Frenzy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 176664367104
    m_Localized: A bloodthirsty killer revels in harming enemies, restoring their
      own vitality through the thrill of slaughter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 247330000896
    m_Localized: Restores HP equal to 30% of Damage Dealt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11938179534450688
    m_Localized: Immortality
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11938181254115328
    m_Localized: One who yearns for eternal life absorbs the fear of dying enemies
      to restore their own life force.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11938182554349568
    m_Localized: 'When a nearby enemy dies: Restores HP equal to 10% of the fallen
      enemy''s Max HP.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
